msgid ""
"To <strong><!--MEMBER_NAME--> (<!--MEMBER_ID-->)</strong>&nbsp;\n"
"         This is notification e-mail to inform you that you have <strong>DUE "
"DATE</strong> library loan,\n"
"        the overdued collection(s) are:"
